<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ CHE deficit improves in March qtr - SNZ.</title>
<headline>NZ CHE deficit improves in March qtr - SNZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The operating result of New Zealand's Crown Health Enterprises (CHEs) for the March 1997 quarter was NZ$17.5 million deficit, Statistics New Zealand said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;This is an improvement of $13.4 million over the deficit in the previous March quarter,&quot; SNZ said.</p>
<p>It said the improving deficit was largely attributable to a fall in non-operating costs, down $11.3 million.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
